     RowBox[{"\"\<     \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       FractionBox["1", 
        RowBox[{"n", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}], ")"}]}]]}], 
      ",", "\"\<\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(R\), \(00\)]\)+\>\"", ",", 
      FractionBox["1", 
       RowBox[{"n", "-", "1"}]], 
      ",", "\"\<\!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(R\), \(11\)]\):  \>\"", ",", 
      RowBox[{"lhs01", "/.", "rulesDisp"}], ",", "\"\< = \>\"", ",", 
      "rhs01"}], "]"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
