Cell[BoxData["\<\"However, options (2) and (3) can be ruled out: each forces \
k = 0 and its integration constant to zero, giving \[GothicCapitalD]\:2084 = \
\[CapitalBeta] = 1, and then R\:2084\:2084 cannot be satisfied because of the \
curvature of the curled 2-sphere.\"\>"], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.999436845325746*^9, 3.9994390382636223`*^9, 
